{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "e-cargo-hub-backend-qa-2026",
    "name": "E-Cargo Hub - Backend QA",
    "description": "Pruebas manuales de la API actual.\n\n1. Importa tambien el entorno E-Cargo Hub local.\n2. Inicia sesion en http://localhost:8081/test-console/ y copia el access token al valor local accessToken del entorno.\n3. Ejecuta primero 00 - Preparacion para crear vehicleId, routeId y warehouseId.\n4. Usa un usuario ADMIN para operaciones de escritura; VIEWER solo puede leer.\n5. Los IDs y credenciales generados se guardan en variables locales del entorno. No exportes ni compartas el entorno con tokens reales.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "test",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "const configured = pm.variables.get('expectedStatus');",
          "const expected = configured ? String(configured).split(',').map(value => Number(value.trim())) : null;",
          "pm.test('HTTP status esperado', function () {",
          "  if (expected) pm.expect(expected).to.include(pm.response.code);",
          "  else pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.within(200, 299);",
          "});",
          "pm.variables.unset('expectedStatus');"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "00 - Preparacion",
      "description": "Ejecuta primero estos requests en Postman Runner. Crean recursos de prueba y guardan sus IDs en el entorno activo.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Crear vehiculo de prueba",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/vehicles"
            },
            "description": "",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Vehiculo Postman {{$guid}}\",\n  \"type\": \"VAN\",\n  \"maxSpeed\": 120,\n  \"energyType\": \"BATTERY_ELECTRIC\",\n  \"energyCapacity\": 90,\n  \"energyConsumptionPer100\": 18\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Vehiculo de prueba creado', function () {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
                  "  const value = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(value.id).to.exist;",
                  "  pm.environment.set('vehicleId', String(value.id));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear ruta de prueba",
